msgid "ReliefDiagram"
msgstr "ReliefDiagram"

msgid ""
"ReliefDiagram 是 ReliefOffice 中的原生思维导图、流程图和逻辑关系图编辑器。 使用 C++17、FLTK 默认 gtk+ "
"控件和系统中文字体，启动命令为 ``reliefdiagram [文档.rdiagram]``。系统菜单位于 Office applications "
"分组， 也提供标准 desktop、应用图标、MIME 和文件管理器默认打开关联。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefDiagram is ReliefOffice's native mind-map, flowchart, and logical "
"relationship diagram editor. It uses C++17, FLTK's default gtk+ widgets, and"
" system Chinese fonts, launched with ``reliefdiagram [文档.rdiagram]``. It "
"appears in the Office applications group and provides a standard desktop "
"entry, application icon, MIME registration, and default file-manager "
"association."

msgid "编写与排版"
msgstr "Authoring and Layout"

msgid ""
"默认示例是项目规划导图；“模板与文档”提供项目规划、审批流程和系统逻辑关系。 “文件 → 新建空白图”创建空文档。新模板会先处理当前文档的未保存修改。"
msgstr ""
"The default example is a project-planning mind map. Templates and Documents "
"offers project planning, approval flow, and system logical relationships. "
"File → New Blank Diagram creates an empty document. Loading a new template "
"first handles unsaved changes in the current document."

msgid ""
"从图形库双击，或使用“开始与插入”工具添加矩形、圆角矩形、判断菱形、 终止椭圆、输入输出、文档、数据库和便笺。选中主题后用 Tab 添加子主题， "
"Enter 添加同级主题；“折叠或展开”只隐藏后代，保留所有文字、备注及关系。"
msgstr ""
"Double-click the shape library or use Home and Insert tools to add "
"rectangles, rounded rectangles, decision diamonds, terminator ellipses, "
"input/output, documents, databases, and notes. With a topic selected, Tab "
"adds a child and Enter a sibling. Collapse/Expand hides only descendants "
"while retaining all text, notes, and relationships."

msgid ""
"连接工具依次点击两个图形，创建附加连线。右侧可设置直线、折线或曲线， 标签、颜色、线宽和无箭头、终点箭头或双向箭头。父子分支自动绘制； "
"逻辑连线独立存在，可以形成回路，但不支持同一图形到自身的连线。"
msgstr ""
"With the connector tool, click two shapes in sequence to add an extra "
"connector. The right pane sets straight, elbow, or curved lines, labels, "
"color, width, and no arrow, end arrow, or bidirectional arrows. Parent-child"
" branches draw automatically. Logical connectors are independent and may "
"form cycles, but self-connections are unsupported."

msgid "画布交互："
msgstr "Canvas interaction:"

msgid "单击选择，Shift 单击多选，在空白处拖动框选。"
msgstr ""
"Click to select, Shift-click for multiple selection, and drag on blank space"
" for box selection."

msgid "拖动图形移动；移动父主题时带上整个分支。右下角手柄调整图形尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"Drag shapes to move them; moving a parent topic moves its entire branch. The"
" lower-right handle resizes a shape."

msgid "中键、右键或平移工具拖动画布，滚轮以指针位置为中心缩放，Home 适合内容。"
msgstr ""
"Drag with the middle/right mouse button or Pan tool to pan; the wheel zooms "
"around the pointer; Home fits the content."

msgid "方向键微调 1 个单位，Shift+方向键移动 20 个单位；网格吸附可独立开关。"
msgstr ""
"Arrow keys nudge by 1 unit, Shift+arrow by 20 units; grid snapping can be "
"toggled independently."

msgid ""
"双击或 F2 编辑文字；右侧可输入多行文字、备注、颜色、字号、坐标和尺寸。 修改后点击固定的“应用属性”按钮或按 "
"Ctrl+Enter。多选时样式作用于同类对象， 文字、备注和位置只修改首个对象。"
msgstr ""
"Double-click or F2 edits text. The right pane accepts multiline text, notes,"
" colors, font size, coordinates, and dimensions. Click the fixed Apply "
"Properties button or Ctrl+Enter after editing. With multiple selection, "
"styles apply to objects of the same type, while text, notes, and position "
"change only the first object."

msgid "“布局与排列”提供左右平衡思维导图、向右树形、流程分层、对齐、等距分布 和置顶置底。流程分层保留回路，不做避障布线，复杂图可手动排布。"
msgstr ""
"Layout and Arrange provides balanced left/right mind maps, rightward trees, "
"layered flows, alignment, equal spacing, and front/back ordering. Layered "
"flow preserves cycles without obstacle-avoiding routing; complex diagrams "
"can be arranged manually."

msgid ""
"Ctrl+C/V 使用应用内部图形剪贴板，包含选中主题的后代与内部连线；Ctrl+D 创建副本。 Delete "
"删除选中对象及其后代和相关连线；Ctrl+Z/Y 撤销重做。"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+C/V uses the application's internal shape clipboard, including selected"
" topics' descendants and internal connectors. Ctrl+D duplicates. Delete "
"removes selected objects, descendants, and related connectors; Ctrl+Z/Y "
"undoes/redoes."

msgid "文件与导出"
msgstr "Files and Export"

msgid ""
"Ctrl+S 保存，Ctrl+Shift+S 另存为，Ctrl+O 打开。磁盘读写与原子保存由后台 "
"子进程处理；保存检测外部修改、拒绝符号链接，并在失败时保留当前文档。 保存之后继续新建、打开或退出的操作，会等待保存成功再进行。"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+S saves, Ctrl+Shift+S saves as, and Ctrl+O opens. Background child "
"processes handle disk I/O and atomic saving. Saving detects external "
"changes, rejects symbolic links, and preserves the current document on "
"failure. New, Open, or Exit actions following a save wait for it to succeed."

msgid "``.rdiagram``：可继续编辑的完整文档，保留折叠分支、备注、样式及视图。"
msgstr ""
"``.rdiagram``: a complete editable document retaining collapsed branches, "
"notes, styles, and view state."

msgid "SVG：完整展开内容的矢量图，文字保持 UTF-8，可继续在矢量工具中处理。"
msgstr ""
"SVG: vector output of all expanded content, retaining UTF-8 text for further"
" editing in vector tools."

msgid ""
"PNG：白色背景，完整展开内容，图形主体最长边不超过 2000 像素，外围留白 24 像素。 图像使用与画布相同的场景绘制，压缩编码在后台子进程进行。"
msgstr ""
"PNG: all content expanded on a white background, with the diagram body's "
"longest side at most 2000 pixels and a 24-pixel outer margin. It uses the "
"same scene rendering as the canvas, with compression encoding in a "
"background child process."

msgid "Markdown：包含所有主题（包括折叠分支）、备注和附加连线的 UTF-8 大纲。"
msgstr ""
"Markdown: a UTF-8 outline containing all topics, including collapsed "
"branches, notes, and extra connectors."

msgid ""
"图片不包含编辑网格、选择框或工具栏。导出禁止覆盖当前原生文档，也会处理 目标文件覆盖确认及写入冲突。SVG 在其他系统上的字形取决于可用字体。"
msgstr ""
"Images omit editing grids, selection boxes, and toolbars. Export cannot "
"overwrite the current native document and handles overwrite confirmation and"
" write conflicts. SVG glyphs on other systems depend on available fonts."

msgid "格式与限制"
msgstr "Format and Limits"

msgid ""
"最多 512 个图形、2048 条附加连线，原生文档与单次导出上限 8 MiB。 文字最多 4096 字节、备注 16384 字节、连线标签 1024 "
"字节；长标签受图形尺寸 限制，画布会换行或省略，完整内容仍保存在文档和大纲。连线标签最多显示 60 个字符。坐标范围 ±100000，图形宽度 "
"40–2000、高度 28–2000，字号 10–48。 历史保留最近 32 次修改；一次拖动是一个撤销步骤。"
msgstr ""
"Limits are 512 shapes, 2048 extra connectors, and 8 MiB for a native "
"document or single export. Text is limited to 4096 bytes, notes to 16384, "
"and connector labels to 1024. Long labels are constrained by shape size and "
"wrap or truncate on canvas, but full contents remain in documents and "
"outlines. Connector labels display at most 60 characters. Coordinates range "
"±100000, shape width 40–2000, height 28–2000, and font size 10–48. History "
"retains the last 32 changes; one drag is one undo step."

msgid ""
"RDGM 版本 1 使用 16 字节文件头：魔数 ``RDGM``、32 位小端版本号、32 位载荷 长度、32 位 CRC32。载荷保存标题、单调对象"
" ID、视图、节点和连线。 解码会校验 UTF-8、唯一 ID、引用、父子循环、有限数值和容量限制，失败不替换 "
"当前文档。首版不导入其他厂商格式，也不提供联网协作。"
msgstr ""
"RDGM version 1 uses a 16-byte header: ``RDGM`` magic, 32-bit little-endian "
"version, 32-bit payload length, and 32-bit CRC32. The payload stores title, "
"monotonic object IDs, view, nodes, and connectors. Decoding checks UTF-8, "
"unique IDs, references, parent-child cycles, finite numbers, and capacity "
"limits; failure leaves the current document unchanged. The first version "
"neither imports other vendors' formats nor provides online collaboration."
